---
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../config";
import BackgroundEffects from "../layouts/BackgroundEffects.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Advanced Programming Project | {siteConfig.name}</title>
  </head>

  <body class="bg-transparent text-white md:pl-24">
    <BackgroundEffects />
    <Header />

    <main>
      <!-- HERO -->
      <section
        class="relative overflow-hidden pt-40 pb-24 px-6 sm:px-10 md:px-16 lg:px-24"
      >
        <!-- glow background -->
        <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10">
          <div
            class="absolute top-24 left-24 h-[28rem] w-[28rem] rounded-full blur-3xl animate-glow-slow"
            style="background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12)"
          >
          </div>
          <div
            class="absolute bottom-0 right-10 h-[30rem] w-[30rem] rounded-full blur-3xl animate-glow-slow"
            style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)"
          >
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
          <!-- TEXT -->
          <span
            class="font-medium tracking-widest uppercase text-xs text-[rgba(245,158,11,0.8)]"
          >
            Advanced Programming Topics • 2024
          </span>

          <h1 class="mt-6 text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold leading-[1.05]">
            Healthcare Appointment<br /> Microservices System
          </h1>

          <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-white/60 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
            A distributed microservices system for managing doctor appointments,
            patients, and doctors. Built using Spring Boot, multiple databases,
            an API Gateway, and full observability with Prometheus.
          </p>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-10">
            {
              [
                "Spring Boot",
                "MongoDB",
                "MySQL",
                "Docker",
                "Prometheus",
                "OAuth2",
              ].map((t) => (
                <span class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 text-sm text-white/70">
                  {t}
                </span>
              ))
            }
          </div>

          <!-- LARGE IMAGE -->
          <div class="mt-14">
            <div
              class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 bg-white/5"
            >
              <img
                src="/images/APT.png"
                alt="Microservices architecture diagram"
                class="w-full h-auto object-contain"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- OVERVIEW -->
      <section class="px-6 sm:px-10 md:px-16 lg:px-24 pb-24">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold">Project Overview</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-[2px] mt-4 bg-[rgba(245,158,11,0.6)] rounded-full">
          </div>

          <div class="mt-12 space-y-10 text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">System Goal</h3>
              <p class="mt-3">
                The goal of this project was to design a scalable healthcare
                platform where patients and doctors can be managed independently
                through separate microservices. Appointments are handled through
                a dedicated service that coordinates communication between the
                other services.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Architecture</h3>
              <p class="mt-3">
                The system is built using a microservices architecture with an
                API Gateway as the single entry point. Services communicate
                through REST APIs and are containerized using Docker Compose.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Core Services</h3>
              <p class="mt-3">
                Patient Service (MySQL), Doctor Service (MySQL), Appointment
                Service (MongoDB), and an API Gateway handling routing and
                authentication via Google OAuth2.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Observability</h3>
              <p class="mt-3">
                Prometheus was integrated to monitor system health, including
                CPU usage, request metrics, response times, and service
                availability.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ENDPOINTS -->
      <section class="px-6 sm:px-10 md:px-16 lg:px-24 pb-24">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold">API Endpoints</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-[2px] mt-4 bg-[rgba(245,158,11,0.6)] rounded-full">
          </div>

          <p class="mt-6 text-white/50 max-w-2xl">
            The API Gateway exposes all core operations for appointments,
            doctors, and patients. Authentication is required for all write
            operations.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-10 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-sm text-white/70">
            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5">
              <h3 class="text-white font-semibold">Appointments</h3>
              <p class="mt-3">
                GET /appointments<br />
                GET /appointments/id<br />
                GET /appointments/patient/id<br />
                GET /appointments/doctor/id<br />
                POST /appointments<br />
                PUT /appointments<br />
                DELETE /appointments
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5">
              <h3 class="text-white font-semibold">Doctors</h3>
              <p class="mt-3">
                GET /doctors<br />
                GET /doctors/id<br />
                POST /doctors<br />
                PUT /doctors<br />
                DELETE /doctors
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5">
              <h3 class="text-white font-semibold">Patients</h3>
              <p class="mt-3">
                GET /patients<br />
                GET /patients/id<br />
                POST /patients<br />
                PUT /patients<br />
                DELETE /patients
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- MONITORING -->
      <section class="px-6 sm:px-10 md:px-16 lg:px-24 pb-32">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold">Monitoring & Deployment</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-[2px] mt-4 bg-[rgba(245,158,11,0.6)] rounded-full">
          </div>

          <div class="mt-12 space-y-10 text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Containerization</h3>
              <p class="mt-3">
                All services were containerized using Docker and orchestrated
                via Docker Compose, allowing consistent deployment across
                environments.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Security</h3>
              <p class="mt-3">
                Authentication was implemented at the API Gateway using Google
                OAuth2, ensuring secure access to protected endpoints.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">
                Prometheus Monitoring
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-3">
                The system was monitored using Prometheus, tracking CPU usage,
                request counts per endpoint, response times, and service health.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Result</h3>
              <p class="mt-3">
                The final result is a fully distributed healthcare backend that
                demonstrates microservices architecture, real-time monitoring,
                authentication, and scalable API design. The system successfully
                separates concerns while maintaining smooth inter-service
                communication.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
